repository-code: 'https://github.com/knappa/phylotriplet'
abstract: >-
  phylotriplet is a C++ library for inferring phylogenetic trees from weighted triplet
  constraints. It implements the Aho et al. algorithm for inferring trees from
  triplets, and extends it to handle weighted triplets and to infer trees with
  polytomies when the input is not fully resolved.
keywords:
  - phylogenetics
